# Package F "Payback": Stripe hires you. Flags: JobAccepted(payback), payback_paid, payback_bribed.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('payback_paid')
goto: Done

cond: HasFlag('payback_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(payback)') && HasItem('stripe_ledger')
goto: Return

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(payback)')
goto: Waiting

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Pink hair. Shift tacts. Calls himself Pinky. He sold my stash list to EBI and they cleaned out every dealer I knew. I want my ledger back. He kept it.
#
o_text: Where is he?
o_id: payback_accept
o_goto: Accepted
#
o_text: Not my kind of job.
o_id: payback_decline
o_goto: Bye

name: Accepted
npc: South district, hiding near the clinic. He's got a strongbox. Bring me the ledger. Three hundred. What happens to him is your business.
effect: SetFlag('JobAccepted(payback)')
effect: EndConversation

name: Waiting
npc: Pinky. South. The ledger. You know the rest.
effect: EndConversation

name: Return
npc: (He flips through the ledger, lips moving.) Every name. Every name he sold.
#
o_text: (Hand it over.) 300 sat, as agreed.
o_id: payback_give
o_goto: Paid
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: payback_keep
o_goto: Bye

name: Paid
npc: Three hundred. (He's already somewhere else in his head.) Now I know who to visit.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'stripe_ledger', 1)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 300)
effect: SetFlag('payback_paid')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: Pinky's still walking around. I can smell him on you.
effect: EndConversation

name: Done
npc: We're done. Don't look at me like that.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Yeah, yeah.
effect: EndConversation
